      automatics: [ { name: "6-Speed Automatic (ZF 6HP19)", torqueLimit: "400 Nm", oilType: "ZF Lifeguard 6", note: "A smooth automatic, but it severely punishes the sluggish N46. The heavy E60 chassis feels agonizingly slow, as the automatic prevents aggressive revving." } ]
