      { label: "Rear Differential", x: 0.01, y: -0.08, z: -0.31, critical: false, details: "MAINTENANCE POINT: Located between the rear wheels. The robust differential can weep oil from the input/output seals over high mileage. Requires periodic fluid checks (75W-90 GL-5)." }
