      { name: "EPROM Chip Tune (Stage 1)", description: "Flashing the Bosch MEVD17.2 ECU via bootmod3 or MHD.", benefit: "THE BEST MODIFICATION. Safely bumps power to roughly 350hp, completely transforming the heavy F10 chassis." }
